================================================================================
Conceptual Inspiration & Attribution
================================================================================

KaiHatch was inspired by the concept of progressive in-place archive extraction
demonstrated by HatchZip (https://github.com/Fabiannez/HatchZip).

KaiHatch is an independent Android implementation written in Kotlin and Jetpack
Compose. It does not include source code from HatchZip and is not affiliated
with, endorsed by, or an official release of the HatchZip project.

